tion class=\"section section--tight\"><div class=\"wrap\"><div class=\"section__head\"><p class=\"eyebrow\">Pricing</p><h1>Priced per person.<br/>Set up by <span class=\"tint\">us.</span></h1><p class=\"lede\">Three plans, one per-person rate, and no implementation project. Pay annually and the setup is included — we create the company, load your people and run your first payroll cycle beside you.</p></div><div class=\"plans\"><article class=\"plan\"><p class=\"plan__flag\" aria-hidden=\"true\"> </p><h2 class=\"plan__name\">Attendance &amp; Leave</h2><p class=\"plan__line\">For a company that needs the days right before it needs the money right.</p><p class=\"plan__price\"><span class=\"plan__amt\">₹<!-- -->49</span><span class=\"plan__unit\">per person<br/>per month</span></p><p class=\"plan__terms\">Billed annually. <b>₹<!-- -->59</b> if you pay monthly — about ₹<!-- -->1.60<!-- --> a day per person.</p><p class=\"plan__min\">From 25 people</p><a class=\"btn btn--lg btn--ghost plan__cta\" href=\"/#contact\">Talk to us <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></a><ul class=\"plan__list\"><li><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg><span>Attendance, night shifts included</span></li><li><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg><span>Leave, approvals and accrual</span></li><li><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg><span>Employee records and documents</span></li><li><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg><span>Biometric reader sync</span></li><li><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg><span>Roles, permissions and audit log</span></li><li class=\"plan__lacks\">Payroll is not included.</li></ul></article><article class=\"plan plan--rec\"><p class=\"plan__flag\">Recommended</p><h2 class=\"plan__name\">Payroll</h2><p class=\"plan__line\">Everything above, plus the month actually closing — the only plan that gets you to a payslip.</p><p class=\"plan__price\"><span class=\"plan__amt\">₹<!-- -->82</span><span class=\"plan__unit\">per person<br/>per month</span></p><p class=\"plan__terms\">Billed annually. <b>₹<!-- -->99</b> if you pay monthly — about ₹<!-- -->2.70<!-- --> a day per person.</p><p class=\"plan__min\">From 25 people</p><a class=\"btn btn--lg btn--primary plan__cta\" href=\"/#contact\">Talk to us <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></a><ul class=\"plan__list\"><li class=\"plan__inherit\">Everything in <!-- -->Attendance &amp; Leave<!-- -->, plus</li><li><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg><span>Payroll run against real attendance</span></li><li><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg><span>Salary structures and payslip PDFs</span></li><li><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg><span>Loss of pay, priced consistently</span></li><li><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg><span>Salary sheet export</span></li><li><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg><span>Reports and analytics</span></li></ul></article><article class=\"plan\"><p class=\"plan__flag\" aria-hidden=\"true\"> </p><h2 class=\"plan__name\">Group</h2><p class=\"plan__line\">For one owner running several companies, each kept properly apart.</p><p class=\"plan__price\"><span class=\"plan__amt\">₹<!-- -->124</span><span class=\"plan__unit\">per person<br/>per month</span></p><p class=\"plan__terms\">Billed annually. <b>₹<!-- -->149</b> if you pay monthly — about ₹<!-- -->4.10<!-- --> a day per person.</p><p class=\"plan__min\">From 100 people across your companies</p><a class=\"btn btn--lg btn--ghost plan__cta\" href=\"/#contact\">Talk to us <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></a><ul class=\"plan__list\"><li class=\"plan__inherit\">Everything in <!-- -->Payroll<!-- -->, plus</li><li><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg><span>As many companies as you run</span></li><li><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg><span>Each one provisioned by us</span></li><li><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg><span>A payroll cycle set per company</span></li><li><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg><span>One invoice for all of them</span></li><li><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg><span>A named contact, priority turnaround</span></li></ul></article></div><p class=\"plans__foot\">Every figure on this page is per person, per month, exclusive of GST. Setup is included on annual billing and ₹12,000 per company on monthly.</p></div></section><section class=\"section section--surface\" id=\"estimate\"><div class=\"wrap\"><div class=\"section__head\"><p class=\"eyebrow\">What that comes to</p><h2>The arithmetic, done for you.</h2><p class=\"lede\">A per-person rate is hard to feel. These are monthly totals at the annual rate, before GST.</p></div><div class=\"tablewrap\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"Monthly cost by company size\"><table class=\"table cmp cmp--money\"><caption class=\"sr\">Monthly cost at the annual rate for four company sizes, in each plan. Group requires at least 100 people across your companies, so smaller sizes show no figure.</caption><thead><tr><th scope=\"col\">People</th><th scope=\"col\" class=\"num\">Attendance &amp; Leave</th><th scope=\"col\" class=\"num\">Payroll</th><th scope=\"col\" class=\"num\">Group</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope=\"row\">25</th><td class=\"num mono\">₹1,225</td><td class=\"num mono\">₹2,050</td><td class=\"num mono\"><span class=\"faint\" aria-label=\"Below this plan&#x27;s minimum\">—</span></td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\">50</th><td class=\"num mono\">₹2,450</td><td class=\"num mono\">₹4,100</td><td class=\"num mono\"><span class=\"faint\" aria-label=\"Below this plan&#x27;s minimum\">—</span></td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\">100</th><td class=\"num mono\">₹4,900</td><td class=\"num mono\">₹8,200</td><td class=\"num mono\">₹12,400</td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\">250</th><td class=\"num mono\">₹12,250</td><td class=\"num mono\">₹20,500</td><td class=\"num mono\">₹31,000</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p class=\"faint\" style=\"font-size:.8125rem;margin-top:var(--s4)\">Pay monthly instead and each figure rises by a fifth, plus ₹12,000 once per company for the setup.</p></div></section><section class=\"section\" id=\"setup\"><div class=\"wrap\"><div class=\"section__head\"><p class=\"eyebrow\">Onboarding</p><h2>You do not implement anything.</h2><p class=\"lede\">This is the part that usually kills an HR rollout: the software arrives empty, nobody has a spare fortnight to fill it, and it quietly goes unused. So we fill it. Here is the work, and it is ours.</p></div><ol class=\"setup\"><li class=\"setup__item\"><span class=\"setup__n\" aria-hidden=\"true\">01</span><div><h3>Create the company</h3><p>Its own database schema, departments, designations, the holiday calendar and the week-off pattern.</p></div></li><li class=\"setup__item\"><span class=\"setup__n\" aria-hidden=\"true\">02</span><div><h3>Load your people</h3><p>Employees, reporting lines, logins, and biometric IDs mapped to the reader if you have one.</p></div></li><li class=\"setup__item\"><span class=\"setup__n\" aria-hidden=\"true\">03</span><div><h3>Build your leave rules</h3><p>Every leave type you use, its monthly accrual rate, and the opening balance each person carries in.</p></div></li><li class=\"setup__item\"><span class=\"setup__n\" aria-hidden=\"true\">04</span><div><h3>Set your payroll cycle</h3><p>The 25th to the 24th, the 1st to the 31st, or whatever yours actually is. Payroll and Group.</p></div></li><li class=\"setup__item\"><span class=\"setup__n\" aria-hidden=\"true\">05</span><div><h3>Build the salary structures</h3><p>Basic, HRA, allowances, PF, professional tax and TDS, per person or per designation. Payroll and Group.</p></div></li><li class=\"setup__item\"><span class=\"setup__n\" aria-hidden=\"true\">06</span><div><h3>Run the first cycle beside you</h3><p>Against a real month of your own attendance, until the figures agree with what you expected. Payroll and Group.</p></div></li></ol><p class=\"setup__foot\">The first time your HR lead signs in, the departments exist, the people are in, the leave balances are right and the cycle dates are yours. What is left is the month — which is the only part that was ever your job.</p></div></section><section class=\"section section--surface\" id=\"compare\"><div class=\"wrap\"><div class=\"section__head\"><p class=\"eyebrow\">Side by side</p><h2>All of it, in one table.</h2></div><div class=\"tablewrap\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"Feature comparison across the three plans\"><table class=\"table cmp\"><caption class=\"sr\">Every feature, and which of the three plans includes it.</caption><thead><tr><th scope=\"col\">Feature</th><th scope=\"col\" class=\"cmp__h\">Attendance &amp; Leave</th><th scope=\"col\" class=\"cmp__h\">Payroll</th><th scope=\"col\" class=\"cmp__h\">Group</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope=\"row\" class=\"cmp__f\">Attendance, including shifts that cross midnight</th><td class=\"cmp__c\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check cmp__yes\" aria-label=\"Attendance, including shifts that cross midnight: included\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg></td><td class=\"cmp__c\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check cmp__yes\" aria-label=\"Attendance, including shifts that cross midnight: included\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg></td><td class=\"cmp__c\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check cmp__yes\" aria-label=\"Attendance, including shifts that cross midnight: included\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg></td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\" class=\"cmp__f\">Month calendar, day sheet and bulk corrections</th><td class=\"cmp__c\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check cmp__yes\" aria-label=\"Month calendar, day sheet and bulk corrections: included\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg></td><td class=\"cmp__c\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check cmp__yes\" aria-label=\"Month calendar, day sheet and bulk corrections: included\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg></td><td class=\"cmp__c\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check cmp__yes\" aria-label=\"Month calendar, day sheet and bulk corrections: included\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg></td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\" class=\"cmp__f\">Leave applications, approvals and balances</th><td class=\"cmp__c\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 2